{"data": {"id": "6bb91ca241b7f14bdd2160e5fc65cc90a90bb98e4026caffa4b4d4e1ca505c3b", "lineage": "6bb91ca241b7f14bdd2160e5fc65cc90a90bb98e4026caffa4b4d4e1ca505c3b", "origin": "sample:2", "parent": null, "source": "import java.util.*;\n\npublic final class Solution {\n    public static Object solve(Map<String, Object> data) {\n        Object gridObj = data.get(\"grid\");\n        if (gridObj == null || gridObj instanceof List && ((List<?>) gridObj).isEmpty()) {\n            return 0;\n        }\n        List<?> gridList = (List<?>) gridObj;\n        int n = gridList.size();\n        if (n == 0) {\n            return 0;\n        }\n        List<?> firstRow = (List<?>) gridList.get(0);\n        int m = firstRow.size();\n        if (m == 0) {\n            return 0;\n        }\n        Number startCell = (Number) gridList.get(0).get(0);\n        if (startCell.intValue() == 1) {\n            return 0;\n        }\n        Number endCell = (Number) gridList.get(n - 1).get(m - 1);\n        if (endCell.intValue() == 1) {\n            return 0;\n        }\n        int[][] dp = new int[n][m];\n        for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j < m; j++) {\n                Number cell = (Number) gridList.get(i).get(j);\n                if (cell.intValue() == 1) {\n                    dp[i][j] = 0;\n                } else {\n                    if (i == 0 && j == 0) {\n                        dp[i][j] = 1;\n                    } else {\n                        int up = (i > 0) ? dp[i - 1][j] : 0;\n                        int left = (j > 0) ? dp[i][j - 1] : 0;\n                        dp[i][j] = up + left;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        return dp[n - 1][m - 1];\n    }\n}"}, "kind": "candidate", "prev": "5eaf57ac0cdcb53639571472dd13307a58cd6e1bd10a446a13a6999a5290642b", "seq": 14}
